| `espresso-500` | `#524135` | Tertiary text, metadata |
| `flour-50` | `#FDFCFB` | Lightest surface |
| `flour-100` | `#FBF9F5` | **Page background (canvas)** |
| `flour-200` | `#F5F1EA` | Subtle surface, badges |
| `flour-300` | `#EAE3D6` | Deeper muted surface |
| `flour-400` | `#D9D0C1` | Disabled / decorative |
| `caramel-400` | `#FBBF24` | Highlights, spark accents |
| `caramel-500` | `#F59E0B` | **Warm accent, warnings** |
| `caramel-600` | `#D97706` | Darker caramel hover |
| `caramel-700` | `#B45309` | Deepest caramel |
| `culinary-400` | `#4ADE80` | Light emerald accent |
| `culinary-500` | `#22C55E` | Mid emerald |
| `culinary-600` | `#16A34A` | **Primary CTA, active nav, success** |
| `culinary-700` | `#15803D` | Deep emerald, text on light bg |
| `stoneBorder` | `#E6DFD5` | **All 1px borders and dividers** |

### Radii

| Element | Class | Pixels |
|---|---|---|
| Cards / large containers | `rounded-2xl` | 16px |
| Buttons / inputs | `rounded-lg` or `rounded-xl` | 8px / 12px |
| Badges / pills | `rounded-full` | 999px |
| Small icons | `rounded-md` / `rounded-lg` | 6px / 8px |

### Fonts

- **Sans:** `"Plus Jakarta Sans", Inter, system-ui`
- **Mono:** `"JetBrains Mono", monospace` — required for all numeric data

### Spacing Grid

- Base unit: **8px**
- Allowed: `4, 8, 16, 24, 32, 48, 64`
- Forbidden: arbitrary values (13px, 27px, 35px)

