## Audit Output Format

When auditing a screen, output this exact structure:

```markdown
### Screen: [Screen Name / Route]
**Audit Date:** [YYYY-MM-DD]
**Compliance Score:** [X/Y passed = Z%]

| ID | Checkpoint | Status | Evidence | Fix |
|----|-----------|--------|----------|-----|
| C-01 | Primary dark text | ✅ Pass | Uses text-espresso-800 | — |
| C-03 | Primary CTA color | ❌ Fail | Button uses bg-blue-600 | Change to bg-culinary-600 |
| T-03 | Numeric font | ❌ Fail | Metric "1,284" uses Inter | Wrap in font-mono |
| S-05 | Card padding | ⚠️ Partial | Uses p-5 (20px) | Change to p-6 (24px) |
| CC-03 | Card radius | ✅ Pass | rounded-2xl verified | — |
| CN-04 | Sidebar background | ❌ Fail | Sidebar uses bg-espresso-900 | Change to bg-white |
| N-01 | Numeric font | ❌ Fail | ₱184.50 uses sans | Wrap in font-mono |

**Priority Fixes (High Impact):**
1. Sidebar is dark — change to `bg-white` (Critical)
2. CTA button uses blue — change to `bg-culinary-600` (High)
3. Metric numbers missing monospace (High)

**Low Priority / Polish:**
1. Card padding should be 24px not 20px (Medium)
2. Badge text size 11px → 10px (Low)
```

### Status Legend

| Symbol | Meaning |
|---|---|
| ✅ Pass | Fully compliant |
| ⚠️ Partial | Close, but needs adjustment |
| ❌ Fail | Violates the rule |
| ➖ N/A | Rule not applicable to this screen |

