## Audit Workflow

1. **Inventory screens.** List every route/page in the app (e.g., `/dashboard`, `/login`, `/orders`, `/settings`, `/recipes`).
2. **Run audit per screen.** Feed screen code + this checklist to the agent.
3. **Aggregate results.** Group failures by rule ID to find systemic issues (e.g., "CN-04 fails on 8 screens = sidebar component needs fixing").
4. **Prioritize.** Fix root causes (design tokens, shared components) before one-off patches.
5. **Re-audit.** After fixes, re-run checklist to confirm compliance.

---

## Priority Levels

| Priority | Definition | Examples |
|---|---|---|
| **Critical** | Brand violation, breaks user trust | Dark sidebar, wrong logo, wrong primary color |
| **High** | Component / color mismatch | Wrong CTA color, missing mono on data |
| **Medium** | Spacing / typography drift | Non-8px padding, wrong heading size |
| **Low** | Polish & consistency | Badge text size, icon size variance |

